m/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118041","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118041.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118041.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-08T14:35:08Z"},"body":"This change fixes the font color and some icons colors in the code completion dropdown menu when the theme is changed due to a change of the system theme.\r\n\r\nThis also fixes #116697 \r\n\r\nCurrent behavior:\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d831517-5ede-432e-ab07-d055b2f179df\r\n\r\nWith this change:\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d0d6be3-0a60-4d0e-ad68-4bf304b044d0\r\n\r\nThis fix include two changes : \r\nOne as pointed out here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116697#issuecomment-3960993322 to clear and rebuild the icon cache on system theme change to fix the icon colors.\r\nAnother change in `CodeTextEditor::_update_text_editor_theme()` to refresh the code completion font colors from the editor settings and resubmit the code completion suggestions with the correct font color if the dropdown is open when the theme change happens. (If the dropdown is not open, the correct font colors are still submitted the next time it is open anyway.)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118041/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}